WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.191
This is Haircut.

00:00:01.191 --> 00:00:05.953
We built a simulated robot barber for AfterQuery’s Break the Agent challenge.

00:00:05.953 --> 00:00:12.700
It gets two hundred and fifty-two actions to trim forty-two patches of hair without touching the scalp.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.495
The agent gets two RGB images and the blade position.

00:00:16.495 --> 00:00:21.049
It chooses one joint turn, camera move, or cut at a time.

00:00:21.049 --> 00:00:22.188
Haircuts are irreversible.

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:28.260
An out-of-range cut spends a step, and one nick costs as much as three perfect patches.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.872
The first Terra run recorded sixty-six nicks.

00:00:30.872 --> 00:00:37.590
The replay showed that sideways turns near the scalp caused damage, even when the blade was not cutting.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.455
Gemini Decision One failed differently.

00:00:39.455 --> 00:00:44.680
It spent two hundred and fifty actions trying to cut from above the hair.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:51.865
We lined up the visible hair with the scored region, improved the cameras, and told Terra to back out before turning.

00:00:51.865 --> 00:00:56.312
On the same seed it finished with zero nicks and trimmed twelve patches.

00:00:56.312 --> 00:01:00.760
Only one reached the target, so depth judgment and coverage are still hard.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:07.484
A scripted controller using blade position and the same joint controls reached sixteen patches with zero nicks.

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:11.836
It uses public geometry and a model of the average head.

00:01:11.836 --> 00:01:15.000
A separate reference with noisy depth reached thirty-three.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.864
Across thirty seeds, doing nothing scored zero.

00:01:17.864 --> 00:01:23.593
Stopping the reference after a quarter of the budget scored point one six seven.

00:01:23.593 --> 00:01:26.866
Cutting without a safety margin scored below zero.

00:01:26.866 --> 00:01:30.140
The full reference averaged point five seven one.

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:35.463
Here the noisy-depth reference shortens all sixteen mohawk crest patches without nicking the scalp.

00:01:35.463 --> 00:01:38.886
You can scrub through every action in the demo.

00:01:38.886 --> 00:01:45.730
The source includes the simulator, the Harbor runner, the action journals and the commands to reproduce the results.
